# Eluge, the Shoreless Sea enters with one Island under Bot1, so it is a 1/1 (CR 604.3: its power and toughness are the
# number of Islands its controller controls). Its enters trigger puts a flood counter on Bot1's Forest, which is then an
# Island as well as a Forest (CR 305.7, 611.2b): it taps for {U} (CR 305.6) and Eluge is a 2/2. With one land with a
# flood counter, the first instant Bot1 casts this turn, Opt, costs {U} less - nothing - so the {U} the Forest made is
# still in the pool once it is cast; the second Opt is not the first and costs its full {U}, which empties the pool.

